                <div class="azure-notes-content">
                    <pre class="azure-notes-text">Microsoft Azure Working
Microsoft Azure is a public and private cloud platform that enables developers and IT
professionals to build, deploy, and manage applications. It relies on virtualization, where a
hypervisor abstracts hardware to run multiple virtual machines with different operating
systems.
   •   Uses hypervisors to run multiple virtual machines on a single physical server.
   •   Supports operating systems like Windows and Linux within virtual environments.
   •   Operates massive data centers with interconnected servers to ensure scalability and
       performance.
Microsoft Azure Architecture</pre>
                    <div class="text-center my-4">
